"P1033067195" "Longbow Defector Profile"
// DetailString :
"P1192382630" "This envelope contains a dossier on the Longbow defector. His name is Geoffrey Richardson, and is an intel coordinator at this Longbow base. He's apparently been offered a great deal of wealth and a posting within Arachnos after rounds of 'Longbow de-programming'."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3508985769" "Okay, we got an extraction job if you're not afraid of going up against Longbow. One of their agents has been speaking with Arachnos and wants to defect. To prove his loyalty, Arachnos wants him to steal a bunch of intel from Longbow before the extraction occurs. Unfortunately, the intel data is very high-profile, so as soon as he steals it Longbow is going to be on him in an instant. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the Longbow base and extract the defector.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3686675371" "Extract Longbow defector"
// SendOffString :
"P408604899" ""Here's the profile on the Longbow defector. He'll wait until you invade the base to steal the data. Then you just need to extract him from the base. Once Longbow realizes what he stole they're going to send everything they have after you, so be prepared."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2480070663" "The Longbow defector is waiting for your arrival! Get to it!"

