"P4004973343" "One of the research labs here on Crimson Cove has been doing some interesting work on controlled mutations. Certain interested parties at Crey would love to get their hands on this research, but the lab isn't interested in selling. Crey has tried 'persuading' the scientists at the lab, but this just resulted in the lab hiring Wyvern to provide security. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to the research lab and force the lead scientist to give you the research data.</A>"
